------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party code incorporated into this project
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This package incorporates code derived from ProteinMPNN
(https://github.com/dauparas/ProteinMPNN, Dauparas et al., 2022) under the
terms of the MIT License. The derived components are primarily the graph
encoder/decoder layers, feature extraction, gather/concatenation helpers,
training-time loss functions, the Noam learning-rate schedule, and the
structure-dataset loader; they appear in foldmapper/model_utils.py and
foldmapper/utils.py.

The upstream MIT License, together with the list of derived components, is
reproduced in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES/ProteinMPNN.txt.
